    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
      {
        "@value": "Each monitoring point should have a unique identification detailed in MONG_ID. Typically this reflects the actual reference or marking on the instrument.\nMONG_DETL should be used to describe the instrument/sensor location or parameter in specific terms.\nMONG_CONT used to include details of which organization installed the monitoring device.\nPIPE_REF is to be used to link the monitoring installation with the appropriate pipe within an installation (for example where there is both a shallow and a deep installation).",
